      "content": "Please set up SAMBAR for somatic mutation calls from 8 pancreatic tumours, with a gene-length table, a cancer-gene list and a KEGG pathway GMT that is not in MSigDB format, so turn gmt_msigdb off. Try kmin 3 up to kmax 8, and keep the normalization by each patient's mutation burden."
